        </noscript></div><div class="prod-mode"><header class="flex flex-wrap w-full"><div id="header" class="flex flex-wrap basis-full"><!--$?--><template id="B:0"></template><h4>Loading component...</h4><!--/$--></div></header><main class="flex flex-wrap utility_bcbst_max_width pt-60 lg:pt-90"><div id="alert" class="flex flex-wrap w-full"></div><div id="hero" class="flex flex-wrap w-full"><div class="component w-full basis-full "><div class="component-content flex flex-col md:flex-row bg-navy"><div class="md:w-1/2 gradient_block padding_hero_text"><h1 class="eyebrow text-white">OUR NETWORKS </h1><p class="title1 text-white">A network for every plan</p><div class="my-24 headline_rule text-white"></div><div class="body1 rich-text text-white [&amp;_a[target*=_blank]]:link_external [&amp;_a[target*=_blank]:has(img)]:after:hidden"><div class="ck-content"><p>We design our networks to offer your employees quality, cost-effective care nationwide. And we can tailor our network designs to help you offer even more affordable plan options for your employees.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start basis-full"></div></div><div class="md:min-h-450 md:w-1/2"><picture><source media="(min-width: 1024px) and (max-width: 1439px)" srcSet="https://content.bcbst.com/api/public/content/comm-getty-171299191_optimized_web_image.webp?v=65192ef4&amp;t=w768"/><source media="(min-width: 1440px)" srcSet="https://content.bcbst.com/api/public/content/comm-getty-171299191_optimized_web_image.webp?v=65192ef4&amp;t=w1024"/><img class="object-cover h-full w-full hidden md:inline-block" src="https://content.bcbst.com/api/public/content/comm-getty-171299191_optimized_web_image.webp?v=65192ef4&amp;t=w768" fetchPriority="high" alt="Two young architects high-fiving each other after a job well done"/></picture></div></div></div></div><div id="content" class="flex flex-wrap w-full utility_bcbst_max_width min-h-200"><!--$--><div class="component basis-full min-w-0 mb-40 sm:mb-60 lg:mb-80 bg-gray6" id="1c0294c3-d628-4996-bd95-458d33288816"><div class="component-content"><div class="component  bg-gray6 "><div class="component-content md:w-2/3 md:basis-auto padding_page_section"><p class="title2 ">Three networks and a variety of options </p><div class="my-24 headline_rule"></div><div class="body1 rich-text  
              [&amp;_a[target*=_blank]]:link_external
              [&amp;_a[target*=_blank]:has(img)]:after:hidden
            "><div class="ck-content"><p>Depending on your company's size, you can choose from up to three of our innovative provider networks for your employees. All of them come with access to <a href="/get-care/teladoc">telehealth</a>, <a href="/our-plans/employer-group-plans/cost-saving-programs#Gcareimagetextleft">value-based care providers</a> and <a href="https://content.bcbst.com/api/public/content/blue-distinction-program-overview.pdf?v=043b630f" target="_blank" title="Blue Distinction®">Blue Distinction®</a> Centers for more specialized care. And if your employees live or travel outside Tennessee, they have access to more than 2 million providers across the country.</p></div></div></div></div><!--$--><div class="component w-full basis-full min-w-0 "><div class="component overline-tile-container flex flex-col gap-20 padding_page_all pt-0 md:grid grid-cols-3"><!--$--><div class="component basis-full min-w-0 overlinetile tile"><div class="component-content flex flex-col h-full"><div class="tile-bar bg-teal px-40 py-8"><div class="body2 text-white">ACA PLANS WITH UP TO 50 EMPLOYEES</div></div><div class="relative flex flex-col justify-start h-full padding_tile card_tile_topper_borders border-t-1 border-t-gray4"><h3 class="title6 mb-24">Blue Network L℠</h3><div class="rich-text body3 mb-24 [&amp;_a[target*=_blank]]:link_external [&amp;_a[target*=_blank]:has(img)]:after:hidden"><div class="ck-content"><p>Network L gives you a nimble, affordable network based on an anchor health system in Memphis, Nashville and Knoxville. Members in Network L get enhanced care coordination and access to quality care, adding up to cost savings for you.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-16 mt-0"></div></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div class="component basis-full min-w-0 overlinetile tile"><div class="component-content flex flex-col h-full"><div class="tile-bar bg-teal px-40 py-8"><div class="body2 text-white">WIDE &amp; COST-EFFECTIVE</div></div><div class="relative flex flex-col justify-start h-full padding_tile card_tile_topper_borders border-t-1 border-t-gray4"><h3 class="title6 mb-24">Blue Network S℠</h3><div class="rich-text body3 mb-24 [&amp;_a[target*=_blank]]:link_external [&amp;_a[target*=_blank]:has(img)]:after:hidden"><div class="ck-content"><p>By selecting Network S, you're giving your employees a wide network of providers that features 87% of the hospital systems in the state and over 45,000 contracted health care professionals in and around Tennessee.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-16 mt-0"></div></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div class="component basis-full min-w-0 overlinetile tile"><div class="component-content flex flex-col h-full"><div class="tile-bar bg-teal px-40 py-8"><div class="body2 text-white">BROADEST NETWORK</div></div><div class="relative flex flex-col justify-start h-full padding_tile card_tile_topper_borders border-t-1 border-t-gray4"><h3 class="title6 mb-24">Blue Network P℠</h3><div class="rich-text body3 mb-24 [&amp;_a[target*=_blank]]:link_external [&amp;_a[target*=_blank]:has(img)]:after:hidden"><div class="ck-content"><p>With Network P, you'll give your employees access to our broadest network, with more than 56,000 contracted health care professionals in and around Tennessee.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-16 mt-0"></div></div></div></div><!--/$--></div></div><!--/$--></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div class="component margin_page basis-full min-w-0 mb-32 sm:mb-40 lg:mb-60"><div class="component-content"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-20 mx-auto md:w-11/12 md:flex-row padding_callout shadow_card_teal"><div class="flex-none"><img alt="-" class="w-70 h-70" width="70" height="70" src="https://edge.sitecorecloud.io/bluecrossblbbe8-bcbst6f41-prod30b1-ef21/media/foundation/icons/svgs/ai-machine-learning.svg?iar=0"/></div><div class="text-center md:text-left grow"><h2 class="mb-8 title5 text-white">We&#x27;re everyw﻿here you need us to be, nationwide</h